{"html": "<p class=\"goal-for\">For losing weight with medical help: the two approved weekly shots, what they cost, and the copies sold online.</p><p class=\"goal-intro\">Two peptide drugs are FDA approved for weight management and need a prescription. Compounded copies and newer molecules sold online are not approved.</p><ul class=\"opts\"><li class=\"opt\"><details class=\"opt-more\"><summary class=\"opt-sum\"><span class=\"thumb thumb-pen-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"56\" height=\"56\" viewBox=\"0 0 56 56\"><use href=\"/assets/art.svg#pen-brand\"/></svg></span><span class=\"opt-m\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"opt-one\"><span class=\"name\">Semaglutide (Wegovy)</span> \u00b7 weekly shot for weight loss</span><span class=\"opt-two\"><span class=\"chip chip-ok\">FDA approved</span><span class=\"opt-rx\">on prescription</span></span></summary><div class=\"opt-body\"><p class=\"opt-plain\">A weekly shot on prescription, for obesity or overweight with a health problem. It cuts appetite.<sup><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/sources/#src-plan-novocare-pharmacy-novo-nordisk-wegovy-pen\" aria-label=\"Source 19\">19</a></sup></p><p class=\"opt-does\">A weekly shot that cuts appetite; about 15 % body weight lost on average in trials. <sup><a href=\"/sources/#src-1\">1</a></sup></p><p class=\"opt-status\">FDA approved for weight management.</p><p class=\"opt-how\">Prescription; online clinics prescribe after a visit. <span class=\"plan-in\">Online clinics from $199/mo (<a href=\"/sellers/novocare-pharmacy-novo-nordisk/\">NovoCare Pharmacy</a>).<sup><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/sources/#src-plan-novocare-pharmacy-novo-nordisk-wegovy-pen\" aria-label=\"Source 19\">19</a></sup></span></p></div></details><span class=\"pick-act\"><a class=\"btn btn-wait btn-sm btn-cta sellers-open\" href=\"/weight-loss/#clinics\" data-dlg=\"clinics-weight-loss-semaglutide\" data-src=\"/windows/clinics-weight-loss-semaglutide.json\" data-ev=\"prices_window_open\" data-ev-substance=\"semaglutide\" data-ev-window_kind=\"clinic\" data-ev-rows=\"6\">Buy from $199/mo \u00b7 6 clinics</a></span></li><li class=\"opt\"><details class=\"opt-more\"><summary class=\"opt-sum\"><span class=\"thumb thumb-pen-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"56\" height=\"56\" viewBox=\"0 0 56 56\"><use href=\"/assets/art.svg#pen-brand\"/></svg></span><span class=\"opt-m\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"opt-one\"><span class=\"name\">Tirzepatide (Zepbound)</span> \u00b7 weekly shot for weight loss</span><span class=\"opt-two\"><span class=\"chip chip-ok\">FDA approved</span><span class=\"opt-rx\">on prescription</span></span></summary><div class=\"opt-body\"><p class=\"opt-plain\">A weekly shot on prescription, for the same use as Wegovy. It had a larger average loss in trials.<sup><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/sources/#src-plan-shedrx-zepbound-pen\" aria-label=\"Source 20\">20</a></sup></p><p class=\"opt-does\">A weekly shot, same idea, larger average loss in trials.</p><p class=\"opt-status\">FDA approved for weight management.</p><p class=\"opt-how\">Prescription. <span class=\"plan-in\">Online clinics from $349/mo (<a href=\"/sellers/shedrx/\">ShedRx</a>).<sup><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/sources/#src-plan-shedrx-zepbound-pen\" aria-label=\"Source 20\">20</a></sup></span></p></div></details><span class=\"pick-act\"><a class=\"btn btn-wait btn-sm btn-cta sellers-open\" href=\"/weight-loss/#clinics\" data-dlg=\"clinics-weight-loss-tirzepatide\" data-src=\"/windows/clinics-weight-loss-tirzepatide.json\" data-ev=\"prices_window_open\" data-ev-substance=\"tirzepatide\" data-ev-window_kind=\"clinic\" data-ev-rows=\"6\">Buy from $349/mo \u00b7 4 clinics</a></span></li><li class=\"opt\"><details class=\"opt-more\"><summary class=\"opt-sum\"><span class=\"thumb thumb-vial-compounded\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"56\" height=\"56\" viewBox=\"0 0 56 56\"><use href=\"/assets/art.svg#vial-compounded\"/></svg></span><span class=\"opt-m\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"opt-one\"><span class=\"name\">Compounded semaglutide or tirzepatide</span> \u00b7 pharmacy-made shot</span><span class=\"opt-two\"><span class=\"chip chip-warn\">Not FDA approved; pharmacy-made</span><span class=\"opt-rx\">on prescription</span></span></summary><div class=\"opt-body\"><p class=\"opt-plain\">Shots mixed by a pharmacy, sold by online clinics on prescription, often cheaper. Not FDA approved.<sup><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/sources/#src-plan-embody-weekly-glp-1-injections\" aria-label=\"Source 21\">21</a></sup></p><p class=\"opt-does\">Pharmacy-made copies sold by online clinics, often cheaper. Not checked by the FDA batch by batch.</p><p class=\"opt-status\">Not FDA approved; pharmacy-made.</p><p class=\"opt-how\">Prescription through the clinic. <span class=\"plan-in\">Online clinics from $49/mo (<a href=\"/sellers/embody/\">Embody</a>).<sup><a class=\"ref\" href=\"/sources/#src-plan-embody-weekly-glp-1-injections\" aria-label=\"Source 21\">21</a></sup></span></p></div></details><span class=\"pick-act\"><a class=\"btn btn-wait btn-sm btn-cta sellers-open\" href=\"/weight-loss/#clinics\" data-dlg=\"clinics-weight-loss-compounded\" data-src=\"/windows/clinics-weight-loss-compounded.json\" data-ev=\"prices_window_open\" data-ev-substance=\"compounded\" data-ev-window_kind=\"clinic\" data-ev-rows=\"66\">Buy from $49/mo \u00b7 31 clinics</a></span></li><li class=\"opt\"><details class=\"opt-more\"><summary class=\"opt-sum\"><span class=\"thumb thumb-vial-research\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"56\" height=\"56\" viewBox=\"0 0 56 56\"><use href=\"/assets/art.svg#vial-research\"/></svg></span><span class=\"opt-m\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"opt-one\"><span class=\"name\">Retatrutide</span> \u00b7 experimental shot, still in trials</span><span class=\"opt-two\"><span class=\"chip chip-neutral\">Not approved; still in trials</span><span class=\"opt-rx\">research use only</span></span></summary><div class=\"opt-body\"><p class=\"opt-plain\">A newer shot still in trials, not approved for anyone. Sold online only in research-use vials.</p><p class=\"opt-does\">A newer three-hormone shot, still in trials. Sold online only from research-use shops.</p><p class=\"opt-status\">Not approved; in trials.</p><p class=\"opt-how\">Research-use shops, with our checks.</p></div></details><span class=\"pick-act\"><a class=\"btn btn-wait btn-sm btn-cta sellers-open\" href=\"/peptides/retatrutide/#sold\" data-dlg=\"sellers-retatrutide\" data-src=\"/windows/sellers-retatrutide.json\" data-ev=\"prices_window_open\" data-ev-substance=\"retatrutide\" data-ev-window_kind=\"research\" data-ev-rows=\"10\">From $0.60/mg \u00b7 10 shops</a><span class=\"paid\">Our checks, no shop links</span></span></li></ul><a class=\"btn btn-ink\" href=\"/weight-loss/\">Compare weight loss options</a>"}